# Place the exported TFLite model here as: skin_triage_model.tflite
#
# This file is produced by the ML pipeline:
#   ml_pipeline/scripts/06_quantise_export.py
# which writes the int8 TFLite model (see config.yaml ->
# quantisation.tflite_output_path). Copy/rename that artefact to:
#   assets/models/skin_triage_model.tflite
# so it matches AppConstants.modelAssetPath.
#
# The model is intentionally NOT committed to version control (it is large and
# regenerated by the pipeline). This .gitkeep keeps the directory tracked.
